light. The smoke never completely obscures her face.\n\nA quiet, sustained breathy exhalation sound is synchronized precisely with the visible smoke. It begins softly, remains smooth and continuous, then gradually fades as the stream becomes thinner.\n\nHer facial expression, gaze, eyelids, eyebrows, head position, and posture remain visually consistent with <Picture 1> throughout the inhale and exhale.\n\nAt approximately 00:10.800, after the main exhale has finished, the adult woman with a quiet, relaxed, low-energy, slightly breathy female voice (S1) continues looking toward the camera and softly says: <d>[Chinese] 要来一口吗？</d>\n\nUse restrained 2D anime facial animation during the dialogue. Keep her overall face and expression visually consistent with <Picture 1>. After speaking, her face returns naturally to the resting appearance established by <Picture 1>.\n\nFrom approximately 00:12.500 to 00:15.000, she remains almost completely still. Her cigarette hand makes only a very small, casual movement slightly toward the viewer, subtly suggesting an offer without changing her body posture. Her fingers remain relaxed.\n\nA thin thread of smoke continues to rise naturally from the cigarette tip. Residual smoke from the earlier exhale slowly curls upward and disperses through the warm light. A tiny amount of ash at the cigarette tip loosens naturally and falls downward near the end of the shot.\n\nThe camera finishes its extremely slow pull backward and holds briefly on the final composition. End with the same character identity, facial expression, gaze, hairstyle, cat ears, clothing, lighting, and overall atmosphere established by <Picture 1>.\n\nSingle continuous shot. No cuts. No scene transition. No sudden camera movement. No head tilt. No nodding. No leaning forward. No body sway. No exaggerated blinking. No eyebrow animation. No expression change. No exaggerated facial animation. No additional characters.\n\nDo not generate any watermark, logo, platform branding,